  "safe_zone_rule": "Use content_margins_px from button_family_metadata.json. Runtime labels/icons must stay inside content_rect_xywh; bevels, claws, scale caps, ruby pins and focus glows are forbidden ornament zones.",
  "implementation_fit_policy": "Before assigning a button asset at runtime, measure the localized label. The rendered text must fit inside content_rect_xywh between the decorative end shutters/caps. Use width = max(audited_width, text_width + left_content_margin + right_content_margin + 24px reserve). If the result exceeds an audited exact size, use/generate the next wider exact-size variant rather than letting text overlap claws, bevels, ruby pins, or scale caps.",
